<title>USA: Pfeiffer Vacuum Q2 earnings per ADS rise.</title>
<headline>Pfeiffer Vacuum Q2 earnings per ADS rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>PFEIFFER VACUUM TECHNOLOGY AG</p>
<p>		  Condensed Statement of Income (unaudited)</p>
<p>		 (In thousands, Other Than Per Share Amounts)</p>
<p>	 Three months ended June 30,    Six months ended June 30,</p>
<p>		 1995     1996     1996     1995     1996    1996</p>
<p>		 DMK	DMK	U.S.$    DMK     DMK     U.S.$</p>
<p> Net sales  50,939  53,652   35,274   99,123  119,022  78,252</p>
<p>Non-recurring</p>
<p>combination</p>
<p>   expenses  3,374	--	 --    3,374	 --	--</p>
<p> Net income    160   2,115    1,391	740    5,520   3,629</p>
<p>Earnings per ADS</p>
<p>		  0.03    0.38     0.25     0.13     0.99    0.65</p>
<p>Earnings per</p>
<p>ordinary share</p>
<p>		  0.20    2.64     1.74     0.93     6.90    4.54</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said its net income, excluding the combination expenses, would have been 1.67 million marks, or 0.30 mark per American Depositary Share (ADS), in Q2 1995 and 2.25 million marks, or 0.40 mark per ADS in first half 1995.</p>
<p>At the end of first half 1996, the company's backlog was 52.7 million marks, up 7.6 percent from Q1 1996.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
